    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about \"adversity\" or \"rebuilding.\" there is no \"me\" left to rebuild. the athlete was the soul. the rest of this is just... a biological machine that's malfunctioning. it feels like i'm just occupying space that should belong to someone who actually has a future. how am i supposed to find a \"new path\" when the very thing that made me human is gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
